&lt;h2&gt;Request fails&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="request-fails"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#request-fails" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Typical causes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;rollout timeout;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;patch rejection;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;provider query failure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inspect controller logs and request conditions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;No request created after source update&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="no-request-created-after-source-update"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
